          "| **User Adoption** | \u2022 Onboarding wizard guides new users through key features. <br>\u2022 In\u2011app analytics track daily active users, feature usage, and churn. <br>\u2022 Dedicated success manager for large orgs. | \u2022 87\u202f% of enterprise customers report \u201chigh\u201d adoption after 90\u202fdays. <br>\u2022 Case study: Company\u202fX (5,000 users) increased usage by 45\u202f% in 6\u202fmonths. |",
